-houhanshu","book_id":"b-houhanshu-071","chapter_id":"c-houhanshu-071-jin044-huabiao","source_id":"s-houhanshu-071-jin044-huabiao","paragraph_id":"c-houhanshu-071-jin044-huabiao:pu","mention_id":"c-houhanshu-071-jin044-huabiao:pu:m0002","quote":"偉容"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082","mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082:m0002","quote":"表"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082","mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082:m0158","quote":"表"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huayi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082","mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-huayi:line082:m0163","quote":"表"}],"identity_note":"平原高唐，華歆子。","review":"ai_provisional","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"7zi_5gs_mq2","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huabiao","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-huabiao","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-huabiao:line077","quote":"華表，字偉容，平原高唐人也，父歆，清德高行，為魏太尉。表年二十，拜散騎黃門郎，累遷侍中。正元初，石苞來朝，盛稱高貴鄉公，以為魏武更生。時聞者流汗沾背，表懼禍作，頻稱疾歸下舍，故免於大難。後遷尚書。五等建，封觀陽伯。坐供給喪事不整，免。泰始中，拜太子少傅，轉光祿勳。遷太常卿。數歲，以老病乞骸骨。詔曰：「表清貞履素，有老成之美，久幹王事，靜恭匪懈。而以疾固辭，章表懇至。今聽如所上，以為太中大夫，賜錢二十萬，床帳褥席祿賜與卿同，門施行馬。」表以苦節垂名，司徒李胤、司隸王宏等並歎美表清澹退靜，以為不可得貴賤而親疏也。咸寧元年八月卒，時年七十二，諡曰康，詔賜朝服。有六子：廙、岑、嶠、鑒、澹、簡。","source_term":"父歆"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-w044-huabiao-xin","interpretation_note":"原文明記兩代；人號不表長幼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"id":"7zi_5gs_mq2_AC","label":"華鑒〔華表子〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"鑒","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-044-huabiao:line077:m0290"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-huabiao",